      "created_at": "2016-12-05T20:57:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Representative of earth changes the max HP of the hero next to it as part of it’s “when this card enters play” text.  When Guise swaps out the hero Representative is already finished entering play, so Guise’s power should change the representative hero’s max HP the way Guise would change the max hp of any other hero character card he uses his power on.</p>",
